  rw [Bool.or_eq_true] at h
  rcases h with h0 | h1
  · simp only [Bool.and_eq_true] at h0; exact checkCutByIdx_sound h0.2
  · simp only [Bool.and_eq_true] at h1; exact checkCutByIdx_sound h1.2

